    {
      "text": "UAE Law No. 32 (2021)  On Commercial Companies  ( \"Law\" ) sets out two legal treatments for interested party transactions.   The first one concerns transactions involving conflicts of interest; the second one concerns related-party transactions.   Under the current regulations, the application of these treatments involves some legal uncertainty that we discuss below.  ",
