          "formatting": {
            "bold": true,
            "italic": false,
            "underline": false,
            "strike": false,
            "font_name": null,
            "font_size": null,
            "color": null,
            "superscript": false
          },
          "hyperlink": null
        },
        {
          "text": ") was adopted; the foregoing Decision clarified which provisions of the law applicable to public joint-stock companies are applicable to limited liability companies and which are not.",
          "formatting": {
            "bold": false,
            "italic": false,
            "underline": false,
            "strike": false,
            "font_name": null,
            "font_size": null,
            "color": null,
